4. Trademarks and model weights
===============================================================================

No model weights are distributed with hipml. The repository contains no GGUF
file, no tokenizer file and no converted weights. hipml is an engine.

The engine is tested on Qwen3.8-27B, specifically the quantized file
Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf. A fine-tune of Qwen3.8-27B that was benchmarked
during development is referred to here only as "a Qwen3.8-27B variant".

Qwen3.8-27B is distributed by its publisher under its own license; check that
license before downloading. That license, not hipml's Apache-2.0 license,
governs your use of the weights. Benchmark numbers in this repository are
measurements of the engine on those weights; they are not claims about the
model, and hipml is not affiliated with or endorsed by the model's publisher.

No AMD ROCm or HIP SDK component is redistributed. The build links amdhip64.lib
and loads amdhip64.dll from the ROCm SDK the user installed; ROCm is under AMD's
own license. Install it from AMD (repo.radeon.com) yourself.

Trademarks are the property of their owners and are used here only to identify
the software or hardware in question, with no claim of affiliation or
